    "query": "My partner and I are heading to London for a 2-day trip this Easter weekend (April 4th to 5th). We're going to base ourselves in East London, so we'd like to stick entirely to venues in Hackney or Tower Hamlets. I want to keep things cheap and include at least 5 budget-friendly venues. However, my partner wants to try nicer places for food, so we need to include at least 4 mid-tier or upscale meals. Also, we like culture but we don't want to overdo it, so please schedule not too many museums\u2014at most one per day."
  },
